+// ── GitHub — full `gh` CLI surface beyond Actions (26 tools) ──
+// PRs, issues, releases, artifacts, repo metadata, Actions secrets, and a
+// generic `gh api` escape hatch for everything not wrapped here.
+//
+// devops.workflows.* already covers the Actions RUN lifecycle (trigger, rerun,
+// cancel, logs). This module is everything else GitHub.
+//
+// The MCP shells out to the `gh` CLI on its host, so the real authority is
+// whatever THAT token can do. Widening this tool surface does not widen the
+// credential: if the token lacks a scope, or cannot see a repo, these tools
+// return gh's own "not found"/"insufficient scope" rather than acting.
